{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99364","id":2183791409,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6CKgMx","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99364","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99364.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99364.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99364","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99364/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99364/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99364/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e653f190322ae4bb572b756fabb6e3950827b183","number":99364,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rewrite some `@GlobalScope` keys in documentation to use `[code]` tags","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/8127\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the descriptions of some `@GlobalScope` **Key** constants to be a bit more elaborate and use `[code]` tags, instead of beginning with the symbol. This not only prevents the symbols from [accidentally being used for formatting](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/8127), but allows the descriptions to be localized a lot better.\r\nIn the meantime, keywords are also added to the affected keys.\r\n\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nThis PR originally was going to use `[kbd]` tags across ALL Keys. However, the idea fell through.\r\nContent in `[kbd]` tags is assumed to be untranslatable, as the engine does not localize keycode text. It also oftentimes made readability worse (for the sake of accuracy), and would've been a massive change for a somewhat cosmetic change. This can be reconsidered another time.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/mil